   "html": "<div style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;color:#111;max-width:560px\">\n<h2 style=\"margin:0 0 6px\">Video 4 of 7: My Ikigai Map</h2>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 14px\"><b>Post on:</b> Wednesday 25 Nov, 20:30 (Israel time)</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 4px\"><b>Caption</b> (copy and paste):</p>\n<div style=\"background:#f3f3f3;border-radius:8px;padding:12px;margin:0 0 14px;white-space:pre-wrap\">Answer 4 simple questions and see your life on one map. Bigger circles mean more balance, and the glowing centre is your ikigai. Free, private, no sign-up. ikigai.elevex.digital (link in bio). (Example map) #ikigai #purpose #selfimprovement #mindset</div>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 4px\"><b>Opening hook:</b> Your life on one map</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 4px\"><b>Cover:</b> What are you actually here for? (attached)</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 14px\"><b>Sound idea:</b> Soft, reflective or motivational sound</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 4px\"><b>How to post</b></p>\n<ol style=\"margin:0 0 14px;padding-left:20px\">\n<li>Save the attached video and cover to your phone.</li>\n<li>TikTok: + &gt; Upload &gt; pick the video.</li>\n<li>Add sound: tap Add sound and pick one from the list (business accounts get the Commercial Music Library).</li>\n<li>Next &gt; Edit cover: if TikTok offers an upload or gallery option, choose the cover file; otherwise keep the first frame (the hook card).</li>\n<li>Paste the caption and post.</li>\n</ol>\n<p style=\"color:#777;font-size:13px;margin:0\">The video has no sound of its own, so whatever you add is the only audio.</p></div>",
